  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 24 + 72 ÷ 12 × 36 - 12 = 168 .\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and -\n\nGiven: 24 + 72 ÷ 12 × 36 - 12 = 168 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 + 72 - 12 × __**36 ÷ 12**__ = 168 \n\n⇒ 24 + 72 - __**12 × 3**__ = 168 \n\n⇒ __**24 + 72**__ - 36 = 168 \n\n⇒ __**96 - 36**__ = 168 \n\n⇒ 60 ≠ 168\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) × and +**\n\nGiven: 24 + 72 ÷ 12 × 36 - 12 = 168 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 × __**72 ÷ 12**__ + 36 - 12 = 168 \n\n⇒ __**24 × 6**__ + 36 - 12 = 168 \n\n⇒ __144** + 36**__ - 12 = 168 \n\n⇒ __180** - 12**__ = 168 \n\n⇒ **168 = 168**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) × and ÷\n\nGiven: 24 + 72 ÷ 12 × 36 - 12 = 168 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 + __**72 × 12 ÷ 36**__ - 12 = 168 \n\n⇒ __**24 + 24**__ - 12 = 168 \n\n⇒ __48____ - 12__ = 168\n\n⇒ 36 ≠ 168\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and -\n\nGiven: 24 + 72 ÷ 12 × 36 - 12 = 168 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 - __**72 ÷ 12**__ × 36 + 12 = 168 \n\n⇒ 24 - __**6 × 36**__ + 12 = 168 \n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 216 __**+ 12**__ = 168 \n\n⇒ __**36 - 216**__ = 168 \n\n⇒ -180 ≠ 168\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
